WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Thank you all for coming. I want to talk about what happened to this industry.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:15.200
The factory closures were caused entirely by the new import tariff introduced last year.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:24.900
Crime dropped the week we deployed the new patrols, so the patrols are why crime dropped.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:36.400
Inflation fell from nine percent to four percent over the two years after the policy,
a decline also seen in most comparable economies during the same window.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:44.100
Wages here have risen more slowly than in the neighbouring state since 2016.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:50.000
The full report will be published on our website next Tuesday morning.
